window.products.push({"id":207128,"name":"Its In the Pot- 7' Inch Springform, Bundt, Cheesecake 3-in-1 Pan For Instant Pot Type Pressure Cookers,Ninja Foodis, Air Fryers and Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fOc+GDaQL._AC_.jpg","description":"HOW DOES THIS PAN DIFFER FROM OTHERS ON THE MARKET? This Springform Bundt,Cheesecake pan for Instant Pot type pressure cookers was custom designed for all home chefs who use their IP's frequently and want professional chef quality that is light weight, sturdy and non-stick. We use Carbon Steel material because it is healthier than aluminum and silicone. Striking CINNAMON RED color makes a beautiful addition to your kitchen cookware. DIRECTIONS ON HOW TO USE YOUR SPRINGFORM : Always assemble your springform pan on a flat surface. Before clasping your pan latch, make sure the base is sitting on a flat surface or counter and ridge (lip) is down to ensure bottom fits tightly. Pan inner lining has a non stick surface but cake will slide out easier if you spray lightly with oil. After baking, remove the springform sides and slide the parchment lined cake off the base and onto a serving plate for a beautiful presentation. Springform pans are made for batters and not recommended for Flan or watery mixtures. ✪ EASY TO USE AND CLEAN—Made from professional-grade nonstick carbon steel, this cheesecake pan with springform release is specially designed to release food easily and be easy to clean. To keep your pan looking newer longer,, use non-abrasive detergent and soft cloths to clean. Always use non-metal utensils to remove from pan and cutting so as not to scratch the protective coating. We are a trusted family owned company and appreciate our customers by offering 24/7 customer service! YOU GOTTA LOVE IT GUARANTEE - If you're not completely satisfied with your springform bundt,cheesecake pan please contact us and we will refund or replace your product immediately. Connect with us on Facebook social media @Itsinthepot for instant customer support,recipes and cooking tips!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fOc+GDaQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Its In the Pot!","source_asin":"B07BW6RHWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BW6RHWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BW6RHWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
