window.products.push({"id":207133,"name":"RAMAKRISHNANANDA Incense Stick Bhairavi Rose & Vanilla, 10 CT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e8GlxwrqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Prabhuji's Gifts Incense Sticks Prabhuji's Gifts beautifully fragrant scented sticks are designed to effortlessly create a spiritual atmosphere and support spiritual practices such as meditation, yoga, relaxation, and mindfulness.  Made with hand-harvested natural ingredients and, blended and rolled by hand in the traditional Indian method by dedicated yogis, infusing energy and intention into every part of the manufacturing process. We believe that sustainable practices are another expression of service, love, and respect to God and humanity. In an effort to promote socially conscious communities, we implement energy efficient practices and produce minimal to zero waste in all manufacturing processes. Our packaging is made from 100% recycled paper, and shipping materials are made from recycled and reused packaging products. FEATURES: Contains 10 Sticks Contains 10 Sticks Made with Natural Ingredients Made with Natural Ingredients Hand-Crafted Hand-Crafted Sustainably Focused Sustainably Focused Socially Conscious Socially Conscious OUR STORY Years of travel, discovery, and spiritual seeking led Prabhuji, founder of Prabhuji's Gifts, Prabhuji to establish a bridge of love between shamanic roots and Eastern wisdom by bringing the \"smell of God\" to the world.  We now sell more than 70 different scents of meditation incense sticks and resins, as well as hand-harvested sage, Vegan Certified perfume attar oils, meditation shawls made from renewable fiber and hand-printed by artisans in India, prayer beads and many other spiritual gift items. Prabhuji’s Gifts is passionate about socially-conscious and environmentally friendly practices. It operates at the highest standards as a gold-level Green America Certified business, gives generously to humanitarian projects, and supports employment of marginalized people in rural villages in India and South America, and the traditional Native American culture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e8GlxwrqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prabhujis Gifts","source_asin":"B00KFPA2HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KFPA2HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KFPA2HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
