window.products.push({"id":207144,"name":"nestl Duvet Cover with Fitted Sheet 4 Piece Set - Soft Double Brushed Microfiber Hotel Collection - Comforter Cover with Button Closure, Fitted Sheet,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917Sj84yRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wake Up to a Brighter Tomorrow The search is over! Say goodbye to restless, sweaty nights and usher in a new era of peaceful, refreshing sleep.Our luxurious bedding is tightly woven and double brushed on both sides, contributing to a silky soft feel and ensuring that our 100% microfiber bedding is softer and more durable than Egyptian cotton sheets or high thread count cotton sheets! Pet Friendly No worries about pet nails and claws! Our bedding is less likely to tear or snag, even when you share your bed with your pets. So go ahead, build a pillow fort and snuggle inside with your best friend.Lightweight, breathable and cool to the touch, our dreamy, soft bedding will create an unforgettable sleeping experience! Easy use and care Protect your favorite down comforter, alternative down comforter, blanket or duvet with a duvet cover. Simply slip the duvet cover over your comforter and secure each corner with the attached ties to keep the comforter in place.The duvet cover fastens with large, clear buttons which are easier to use, less likely to come undone and blend in seamlessly.We created Nestl to bring you soft, beautiful bedding at fair prices. As pioneers at the forefront of the bedding industry, we are proud to present you with affordable,high-quality bedding, crafted from premium microfiber material and made to last. Nestle between our silky soft bedding for a sleep so sublime, you’ll wonder if you’re dreaming!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917Sj84yRFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestl","source_asin":"B07MCDH91D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCDH91D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCDH91D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
