window.products.push({"id":207188,"name":"Threadmill Cotton Full Size Sheet set| 100% Cotton Sheets for Full Size Bed | Solid Sateen Full Bed Sheets Set with 16” Elasticized Deep Pocket | Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnF5gXIwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL-IN-ONE SOFTNESS & COMFORT WITH 100% PURE COTTON SATEEN BEDDING: Welcome cool and cozy sleepy nights with our simple, everyday use 300 thread count collection. Crafted with long staple cotton yarns, these smooth sheets have the unmatched comfort, lightweight, and softness of a cloud. This signature sateen weave bedding set provides remarkable elegance and durability, making them completely worth the price. LIGHTWEIGHT BEDDING SET WITH SNUGLY FITTING DEEP POCKET BOTTOM SHEET: Enjoy breezy nights and forget night sweats with our cooling and airy 300 thread count sheets. Each 4 piece Full sheet set includes 1 flat sheet (81\" W x 100\" L), 1 fitted sheet (54\" W x 75\" L + 16\" deep pocket) and 2 Standard pillowcases (20\" W x 30\" L).. Designed to snugly fit your mattress, the elasticized bottom sheet comes with a sizable deep pocket and stays tucked through the night. CONVENIENT, MACHINE WASHABLE BED LINENS WITH UNBEATABLE QUALITY: Get affordable bedding with the quality of higher thread count sheets in our 300 thread count sheet set. Each set is expertly made using superior quality materials to ensure pill resistance, fade resistance, and long-lasting strength. They get softer and softer with every wash, making them worth every penny. To avoid shrinkage and wrinkles, machine wash them at room temperature, tumble dry on low and fold them neatly right after. ACCENTUATE YOUR BEDROOM DECOR WITH ELEGANCE: Master bedroom or guest room, our simple yet classy cotton sheets are perfect for every room in your house. Our elegant 300 thread count range is meant for affordable yet ultimate bedroom experience. Give your bedroom a pop of color or add a subtle hue of pastel, these divine sheets can work wonders for all. With attractive colors, these bedding sets also bring with them an undeniable cozy feel & comfortable touch for the ideal good nights’ sleep. CERTIFIED & SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We take pride in making some of the world’s finest linens while respecting the environment. Our products and practices are free from harmful chemicals, earning the OEKO TEX certification. All these premium sheets are manufactured in wind and solar energy powered factory. They are packed in a zero plastic, reusable cotton tote bag and delivered with a 100% satisfaction guarantee, giving you exceptional customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnF5gXIwS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Threadmill","source_asin":"B073CVJ8BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073CVJ8BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073CVJ8BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
