window.products.push({"id":207190,"name":"Milk Frother rechargeable mixer handheld egg whisk 3-Speed Adjustable with 2 stainless steel mixer heads suitable for coffee, tea, latte, hot chocolat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617XRjYWYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Made with Good Materials】: This Electric milk frother is made of high-quality materials. Handle is non-slip ABS material, Blender portion is made of 304 stainless steel, safe and green. The electric mixer heads is easy to clean, just immerse into water and it will be completely clean in a few seconds. 【Three-speed adjustable】: It is equipped with 3 stirring speeds, allowing you to choose the right speed to get the desired amount of foam. When in use, just push the button to select the gear. The first gear is fast rotation at about 7000 rpm, the second gear is medium speed, and the third gear is slow speed. You can choose the desired speed level according to different mixing needs. It takes about 30 to 60 seconds for milk to foam. 【Good Helper for Delicious Desserts】: Enjoy milk, coffee, macha ,milkshake or hot chocolate with a hand-held milk frother at home or in the office. Taste delicious desserts anytime, and enjoy a happy life. The rechargeable foamer comes with 2 stainless steel whisks, a ball-shaped whipping head, and a spring-loaded whisk. 【Easy to carry】Our electric handheld milk frother is small and light, whether it is at home, office, or traveling, you can take it with you, stir drinks, froth coffee, milk, bring convenience to your life,use the coffee frother let you enjoy more delicious life. 【Tips】: In order to prevent the liquid from being splashed, please put an appropriate amount of liquid such as egg white, milk, and coffee into the container.When using,please immerse the whisk into the liquids first,then push the button to adjust the speed,The speed is fast/medium/low from bottom to top，the milk frother begin to work,push the button again,milk frother stops working,please read the Instruction manual before to use the milk frother.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617XRjYWYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"URBDOMYJA","source_asin":"B09XKC2DVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XKC2DVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XKC2DVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
