window.products.push({"id":207256,"name":"GentleNight | 10\" Omniconstructed Premium Mattress | Bed in a Box | 60 Night | Accord Comfort Sleep Systems | Made in USA (California King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hAPOBF8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCEPTIONAL VALUE AND QUALITY – Your GentleNight mattress by Accord Comfort Sleep Systems offers you a truly unique \"bed in a box\" mattress, with our quilted top. This provides a slightly more gentle body comfort layer, while still using the best in base and core support with our exclusive Accord Comfort Reflex Layer. MADE IN THE USA - You'll breathe easier and wake feeling rested and refreshed, knowing the materials in your bed are also completely safe and nontoxic for use by anyone of any age. Being locally made and not imported, makes sure that we have complete control of the quality of materials and construction. NEVER AGAIN WORRY ABOUT HIP AND SHOULDER PAIN - Because of the high-quality memory foam construction, your GentleNight mattress is supportive to conform to your body's unique shape so you don’t ever have to lose sleep over pressure points that can cause hip and shoulder pain. Unlike beds made from metal springs, your mattress is made with gel-infused latex, high density transition foam for comfort and support, and our Accord Comfort Reflex layer, to offer deep down comfort. A MATTRESS THAT’S BREATHABLE AND COOL – Early models of memory foam beds weren't very breathable, leaving many people with Omniconstructed Premium mattresses to complain about feeling sweaty and uncomfortable. GentleNight is different because it's designed to give you a breathable and cool nights sleep because of how it’s manufactured. The result gives you the best nights sleep while transferring heat through a wick-away technology, while keeping the top of the mattress breathable and cool. OUTLAST COVER FOR PREMIUM SLEEP EXPERIENCE – With your GentleNight mattress, you’ll get a great night’s sleep that’s not too hot and not too cold. With Outlast technology built into your bed, you’ll experience a proactive management of heat and moisture to give you a better, more comfortable rest. Outlast technology is tested and proven to alleviate spikes in skin temperature that cause sleep disturbances.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hAPOBF8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accord Comfort Sleep Systems","source_asin":"B07VVHDP26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VVHDP26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VVHDP26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
