window.products.push({"id":207271,"name":"craftsartisanat Moroccan Pouf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CDJ-hC9mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Moroccan leather poufs are a must have for any room of your home and our now available on pre order in my store I have one in every room of my house including the bathroom because you know someone always wants to chat about something when you are trying to relax! These authentic leather ottomans have so many uses around your home, they can be a footstool or used as extra seating, from the living room to the bedroom to the kids playroom. All of these leather poufs are individually made by artisans in Morocco and ethically purchased using fair trade. After sourcing and buying the goat skin, it is cut and hand painted or dyed, then sent to the outskirt of Marrakech to be stitched and finished with silk embroidery by local Moroccan women to show off expert craftsmanship and a result that is durable and will stand the test of time. There are five people involved in making each pouf and it takes up one day to complete it. They are all wonderfully unique, with subtle variations in the colour of the leather and will look beautiful and last for many years to come. Below are all the colours I have in store but if there is a colour you love and you don't see it here, please send me a message and I'll see what I can do size dimension:20 to21 inch high : 12 to 13 inch note: we only sell cover pouf not stuffed pouf coz it cost for extra money shipping We sell retail and wholesale Feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CDJ-hC9mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"craftsartisanat","source_asin":"B0816ZXWWX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0816ZXWWX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0816ZXWWX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
