window.products.push({"id":207279,"name":"Luxury Satin Pillowcase for Hair – Queen Satin Pillowcase with Zipper, Pink (1 per Pack) – Blissford","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yVpK1aDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECTS YOUR HAIR AND SKIN. Satin pillowcases are one of life's simple pleasures. They're silky soft against your skin, reducing facial creases and wrinkles. Satin pillow cases also keep your hair safe from harm, preventing matting, breakage, tangling and snagging. You will wake up each morning with healthy skin and beautiful hair. COMFORTABLE AND DURABLE. Cool in the summer and warm in the winter, a satin pillowcase is a luxury to be enjoyed throughout the year. Our Satin Pillow case is made with high quality thread-count 100% polyester fabric for optimal softness and easy care. The hidden zipper closure prevents slipping and ensures that the pillow stays perfectly in the pillowcase. LOADS OF COLORS. We offer a fabulous selection of colors, from soft tones to bright tones of color, you're sure to find a satin pillowcase that complements your decor. Sweet Dreams Satin Pillowcases are available in: black, brown, burgundy, camel, champagne, gold, grape, hunter, ivory, jewel blue, light blue, lavender, navy, pewter, pink, red, rose, royal, sage, seafoam, teal, yellow, black zebra print, brown zebra print, jaguar print, leopard print, and white satin pillowcase. TOP QUALITY CONSTRUCTION. Experience the luxury of our Sweet Dreams satin pillow cases. These satin pillowcases are constructed from 100% woven polyester which gives it its smooth finish and exceptional longevity, even after extensive wash and wear. Wrinkle free, stain and fade resistant, easy to care for, machine wash cold, tumble dry low. RISK FREE SHOPPING. We believe that you will love this Satin Pillowcase as much as we do. But in case you don't, we offer a 100% money back guarantee. No questions asked. Because we want you to be happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+yVpK1aDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHOPBEDDING","source_asin":"B082WPMKK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082WPMKK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082WPMKK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
