window.products.push({"id":207305,"name":"COLAMY Tufted Dining Chairs Set of 4, Upholstered Parsons Dining Room Chairs, Fabric Kitchen Side Chair with Nailhead Trim and Wood Legs - Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p6XUZk3eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❗❗❗Package Shipping: Shipping with two boxes. If you miss a box, please feel free to ask Amazon or COLAMY for the second tracking number. Notice: each box contains 2 dining chairs; the legs and screws are packed in a zippered compartment at the bottom of the chair seat cushion. 🍀 MODERN AND TRADITONAL- Features handmade diamond tufting detail with deep inset buttons, aged nailhead trim, camel back curves, tapered front legs and flared back ones, higher back and wider seat, providing a touch of panache to the bold look. 🍀 6\" THICKNESS SEAT CUSHION- Our parsons dining chairs have soft thick padded cushion seats covered in classic linen-look fabric which is breathable and comfortable, and also easy to clean. You'll feel supper comfy and supportive sitting and relaxing in these upholstered chairs. 🍀SELECTED MATERIALS AND HEAVY BUILT- Constructed with a soild wood frame with black finish rubber wood legs that can hold up to 250 lbs. Rubber feets on legs of tufted parsons chair aim to prevent the floor from scratching. Our rustic dining chairs are heavier (43.5lbs) than ordinary ones so as to keep it excellent durablity and stability. 🍀VERSATILE USAGE- Come with (2) two dining chairs, the set is ideal for family gatherings or dinner parties with friend and widely used for daily dining or special events like meetings, wedding banquets, and celebrations in the living room, meeting room, hotel, restaurants, or etc. 🍀EASY TO ASSEMBLY AND LARGER SIZE - Just need minor assembly and takes about 10-20 minutes to assemble. Overall Size: 42.32'' H x 20.28'' W x 25.98'' D, Seat Size: 20.28'' W x 17.52'' D x 20.16\" H. 🍀12-MONTH WARRANTY AND DEDICATED CUSTOMER SERVICE- For COLAMY farmhouse dining chairs, we provide free part replacements within one year. Any question, please feel free to contact the manufacturer-COLAMY (contact info in the user manual) and they will help you out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p6XUZk3eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLAMY","source_asin":"B0C3DFKZLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3DFKZLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3DFKZLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
