window.products.push({"id":207348,"name":"Xia Home Fashions Shimmer Snowflake Embroidered Cutwork Round Christmas Doilies, 8-Inch, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81swCGvelQL._AC_SL1214_.jpg","description":"Crisp shimmer snowflake cutwork linens collection features lovely hand rendered snowflake cutwork. This collection will make it a holiday season to remember. As your definitive home décor destination, Xia Home Fashions feels that every day should be lived fashionably! Our distinctive designs, rich details, and tempting accessories are sure to endlessly fulfill your home’s finicky fashion sense. Whether you are keeping up with the ever changing colors of the holidays and seasons, looking for a stunning piece to tie your existing interior décor together while staying in tune with your individual style, or simply in need of an easy care focal point for an upcoming party or event, Xia Home Fashions has stylish creations that will complete your look and win complements at your next gathering!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81swCGvelQL._AC_SL1214_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xia Home Fashions","source_asin":"B00MX40NNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MX40NNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MX40NNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207349,"name":"Equaliteria Portable Stainless Steel Grey French Press Travel Mug with Filter and Double Wall Insulated Thermos Kettle Hot or Cold Coffee/Tea Maker Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Es97rsbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Making coffee was never that easy all you have to do ISA) place desired amount of ground coffee beans into the French press and gently shake it back and forth to settle on the bottom. B) pour about half of your hot water evenly over the beans. This step is called the bloom. Hot water forces the ground coffee to release trapped gases, leading to expansion of the coffee and wonderful aromas for you to enjoy. During this bloom, a thick \"crust\" of coffee grounds will form C) wait 30 seconds and stir the coffee gently for 5 seconds to break up the crust and mix the grounds evenly with the water. D) now pour the remaining half of your hot water over the coffee and keep it covered for another 3 minutes and make sure that the filter and top outlet is open before pressing down the plunger) lower the sieve in the plunger, smartly settling the residue at the bottom base. Now you can drink or take away your favorite coffee.Advatages1- with this French press, keep your coffee hot and your lemonade cool for up to 4-6 hours. Designed in a way to keep the contents of this mug completely insulated, it doesn't let the environment take away the freshness of the contents. It also comes with an inner cup contained inside the thermal kettle mug that allows you to enjoy your drink on the go 2- leek proof - double lid with silicone seals keeps your drink safe.3- special fixture on the plunger to separate sediment from the finished coffee the moment you screw down the lid. No worries of the over extracting of bitter and astringent taste.4- easy to wash and clean5-BPA free bps free phthalate free most of all its compact and portable, so add to cart and save money .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Es97rsbbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Equaliteria","source_asin":"B01MSUFKJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSUFKJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSUFKJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207350,"name":"Scandinavian Swan Hanging Mobile - 22 Inches - Handmade in Denmark","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5F+Ayb5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F5F+Ayb5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B0017OKHLA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0017OKHLA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0017OKHLA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
