window.products.push({"id":207607,"name":"Pooqla 4th of July Decorations Lighted Star Tree, Patriotic Decor Tabletop Tree Light with 4 Hanging Balls Battery Operated & USB Powered for Memorial","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71feO1XQtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable LED Tree with Patriotic Ornaments: Adjustable branches can be DIY for customized shape. It’s easily adjustable to your liking to create fullness and direction depending on how you want it to look. Packed with 4 hanging ball ornaments and 3 wooden American flag stars. Decorate your own Independence Day tree light. 8 Lighting Modes Tree Light with Remote: Combination, In waves, Sequential, Slo-glo, Chasing/flash, Slow fade, Twinkle/flash, Steady on for choice. You can control flashing modes with remote or button. The most amazing thing is that you can even control the brightness of light and definite time. Easy to Set Up: The star pot light tree is divided into two parts, just need to align the hole and insert it to complete the installation. Overall height is 21.6\", width is 17\",flowerpot is 4\"*5.2\", star is 1\"*1\". On/off switch button situated on the base enabling easy operation. Before snapping the pot, turn on the switch to test the lights first. Battery and USB Powered Decorative Patriotic Light: This patriotic LED tabletop star tree can be powered by 3 AA batteries (Not Included) or USB. Portable batter powered tree for easily carrying. Do not plug in the wire when powered by batteries, or the light won't on. Patriotic Decorative Star Lights: Elegant tree light with Americana stars for decorating home, office ,wedding, party, bedroom, living room, kitchen, balcony, room, etc. This LED tree is suitable for any patriotic themed occasion like July 4th, Veterans day, Memorial day, Independence Day, Flag Day, Veterans day, National Day, Armed Forces Day, Presidential Election and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71feO1XQtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pooqla","source_asin":"B09VT1H745","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VT1H745","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VT1H745","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207608,"name":"Elegant Home Western Texas Star Stars Horse Horses Riding Cowboy Design 3 Piece Coverlet Bedspread Quilt # Cowboy (Brown/Chocolate, Full/Queen Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+eg1yE9bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Change your bedroom into a soothing sanctuary with this Deluxe coverlet / bedspread. Your bedroom will look absolutely striking with this beautifully-soft-colored printed bedding that will make a charming addition to your bedroom and bring a calmness to your bed, while the soft solid colors allow you to relax and wind down in your own bedroom","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+eg1yE9bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Home Decor","source_asin":"B07NJ99H1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NJ99H1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NJ99H1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207609,"name":"ZINUS Mikhail Sofa Couch / Ruby Red / Button Tufted Cushions / Easy, Tool-Free Assembly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4OzyGJ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Mikhail Sofa may be inspired by the mid-century, but we’re confident that it can bring your living area or family room’s ambiance up to date. To make this lively piece work with your existing decor, you only need to be a fan of timeless touches, like its charming button tufting and clean silhouette. Built sturdy with dense foam and spring cushions, it features medium-firm seating that can comfortably accommodate three people (or maybe just you if it’s time for that afternoon catnap). What could make this purchase even more simple, you ask? An included one-year worry-free warranty and an assembly time that clocks in under 20 minutes. We like to think of it as confident style, all in one box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s4OzyGJ4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B07HHSMN4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HHSMN4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HHSMN4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207610,"name":"RUGPADUSA, Ultra Black, 2'x4', 1/3\" Thick, Felt + Rubber, Non-Slip Cushion Rug Pad, Available in 3 Thicknesses, Safe for Hardwood and All Surfaces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1GXKAm+g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra black 1/3 inch rug pads provide the ultimate support system for your oriental, Persian, or area rug. Ultra black 1/3 inch is a 100% felt and rubber rug pad designed for keeping rugs anchored to the floor while providing comfort and cushioning under your rugs. We offer a signature Jet black natural rubber backing, which combines a full 10oz/sq. yd. Of rubber with a reinforced 5oz/sq. Yard rubber face to prevent fraying, flaking, and premature wear. Our signature Jet black backing is combined with a 1/3'' (27 ounce) layer of felt to help support and cushion your area rugs. This dense fiber core helps prolong the life of your area rugs by reducing wear and tear from daily use. This added layer of felt protection also provides insulation, noise reduction, and acoustical benefits. Ultra black 1/4 inch works well with all types of rugs, but especially with thinner flat woven rugs such as kilim, durries, and sumac rugs. Ultra black 1/3 inch is manufactured with 100% felt & rubber and contains no glues or adhesives that can outgas, offering a more natural & rug pad alternative to traditional plastic, vinyl, and PVC rug pads. Our felt is heat pressed to the rubber, not glued, for added durability. As the cost of rubber increases, Manufacturers have been using more \"classy fillers\" In their rug pads to reduce costs. The more classy fillers are used, the faster the rubber backing will fall apart and crumble. The alternative to most felt and rubber rug pads is traditional open weave PVC padding. While more cost effective, these overseas pads can often outgas and may contain potentially toxic chemicals and plasticizers such as phthalates and formaldehyde. Both bad for the environment and bad for your floors, out-gassing from inferior padding can react with certain floor finishes to leave them permanently stained and discolored. Ultra black 1/3 inch is manufactured in the USA using only 100% felt and rubber materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1GXKAm+g8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGPADUSA","source_asin":"B01HFF5RKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HFF5RKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HFF5RKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
