window.products.push({"id":207686,"name":"Droll Yankees Ant Moat Model DYAM (4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511xLsRav1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This sweet little Ant Moat offers protection for your hummingbird feeders. When filled with water, this little cup forms a barrier that keeps ants away from the irresistible nectar of the hummingbird feeders. It has a 3/4 cup capacity that offers days of protection. Constructed of striking ruby red UV stabilized polycarbonate, the ant moat is durable and long lasting. It is a reliable first line of defense against ants. Now in a 4 Pack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511xLsRav1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Droll Yankees","source_asin":"B07R18J15G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R18J15G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R18J15G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":207687,"name":"Green Goddess Supply Solid Pinewood Pollen Sifter Box - 100 Micron Mesh Sifting Screen - Herb & Pollen Shaker & Storage Case - Magnetic Closure - 3-Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZuDs0LLQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SHAKE - SIFT - STORE: Pollen is the caviar of herbs, and can be used to enhance the potency of your herbal concoctions. The three-tiered construction of this pollen sifter box allows you to add your herb, shake it, and release the desired pollen from its dried buds, filtering and sifting it through fine quality mesh. The end product is pure, fine pollen dust. The case can then be used to safely store your herbs and pollen. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS: This large sifter box has a sturdy natural pine wood construction, high-strength magnetic seals, 100 micron mesh screen, and a smooth tempered glass catch tray. The durable pinewood creates a sturdy enclosure that is ideal for extended daily use, while the strong magnets securely hold each section of the box together to ensure the herbs and pollen stay separated. The fine mesh screen and glass catch tray provide optimal pollen filtering and collection. PREMIUM DESIGN: Three separate pieces connect seamlessly to make a lid, filter section, and catch tray. This box features a high-quality mesh screen in the middle to help filter the pollen from your herb, which is then collected in the bottom catch tray of the box. The bottom section of the box is fitted with a removable glass catch tray, allowing for easy gathering of pollen particles. As an added bonus, the box lid is equipped with a magnetic rolling 'V' and paper storage compartment! THE PERFECT GIFT: This beautiful, solid pinewood pollen sifter box makes an ideal gift for the discerning connoisseur in your life. The high-end design, quality materials, superior filtering, and versatile herb and pollen byproduct storage capability make this box a gift that will be appreciated and used for years to come. It is perfect for a birthday, any other gift-giving occasion, or just because! TRUST GREEN GODDESS: With years of designing, sourcing, and selling, Green Goddess Supply continues to flourish with new, innovative products that fulfill our mantra to “delight our customers with quality products”. For herb grinders, storage boxes, and more, we are your one-stop shop. Our organic approach to growth allows us to perfect each design, providing you with products that are beautiful, functional, and made to last for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZuDs0LLQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Goddess Supply","source_asin":"B01HBXP7ME","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HBXP7ME","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HBXP7ME","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
