window.products.push({"id":207878,"name":"Rythome Set of 2 Decorative Pattern Throw Pillow Cases, Comfortable Quilted Velvet Cushion Covers for Sofa Couch and Bed - 18\"x18\", Dusty Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DmuaPcTXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Brand: Rythome Contain: 18\"x18\" Square, 2 pieces. COVER ONLY. Intended Use Durable, anti-wrinkle, noble, elegant for bed, couch, sofa, chair, bench, loveseat in room, balcony, patio, office, hotel, cafe, lounge. All seasonal choices in fall, winter, spring and summer for adults, seniors, teens, children or toddles. How to Choose Pillow Insert Size It's typically recommended to use a pillow insert 1-2 inches larger than the pillowcase for a nice plump pillow, especially for the older flattened pillows or fiber fill. The toss pillow cover features 18\"x18\", for best results, now 20\"x20\" polyester inserts are recommended to buy together with the items to provide full pillow from corner to corner.  The hot high quality square pillow inners may be found on http://a.co/d/hF43sw9, http://a.co/d/9l7Mhk5. Slight Color Variation or Size Biases Many factors result in slight color variation between physical items and the images on your screen, muted appearance, photographing ambient light, shooting angle, screen resolution. Acceptable size biases may occur in handmade process. Quilted Velvet VELVET, a silken textile fabric having a short dense piled surface, is a type of woven tufted fabric in which the cut threads are evenly distributed, with a short dense pile, giving it a distinctive soft feel. Velvet can be made from either synthetic (polyester, nylon, viscose) or natural fibers (silk, cotton, linen, wool) QUILTED VELVET, a fabric construction in which a layer of PP-cotton is placed between two layers of velvet and non-woven , and then held in place by stitching or sealing in a regular, consistent, all-over pattern on the goods. Washing Tips Machine wash warm. No bleach or iron. Tumble dry low or air dry. Freshen up with stream.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DmuaPcTXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rythome","source_asin":"B07J41ZNDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J41ZNDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J41ZNDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
