window.products.push({"id":207890,"name":"DKLGG Meat Thermometer Accurate Digital Instant Read, Electronic Cooking Kitchen Thermometer with LCD Display, Foldable Long Probe for Food, Candy, Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Mf-3D3WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Meat Thermometer Features: -Unique Fast Reading system achieves an accurate temperature reading within 4 - 7 seconds. -Saving max temperature records by pressing °C/°F key for 6 seconds (MAX button records the maximum temperature) -STEP-DOWN probe tip thermometer to get temperature more precisely and quickly. -Display in F or C (default is F),a key switch,easy to use. - Foldaway probe is designed for safety and cleanliness. - Ultra-clear screen LCD display. -Battery power saving design. Cooking Thermometer Specifications: - ℉/℃ switchable. -Materials: ABS, SUS304. - Large LCD display, easy to read. - Laminated Meat Temp Guide Included. -Range of -58°F ~ 572°F (-50°C ~ 300°C), accurate to ±1°F. - To change the battery,open the case on the reverse side of the thermometer. Replace with an AAA battery. -Before withdrawing the probe from the food, press \"HOLD\" button. It will display the temperature reading until pressed again. Package Contents: 1 x Digital Thermometer (Battery not included) Attention: 1. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking, do not touch hot probe with bare hands. 2. Before withdrawing from food, press HOLD button. It will hold the temperature reading. 3. Wash the metal probe in soapy water. Clean thermometer by hand. Do not completely immerse in water.  4. The folding probe is with a sharp tapered end, fold away when not in use making the wireless unit a small and convenient size for your pocket or drawer. Warranty: Every product includes a 30 days money back & 6-month worry-free guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Mf-3D3WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKLGG","source_asin":"B08FRGD653","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-207890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRGD653","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRGD653","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
